WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,400
Okay, I knew you two had a problem.

2
00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:04,600
Second Sister Rou, you can come, but we can’t.

3
00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:06,200
You were pretending to be like a little white rabbit before

4
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:08,400
The movements from behind are quite fast, each other.

5
00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:09,800
You don't want to hide it from us for so long

6
00:00:09,800 --> 00:00:11,800
If you want to make a noise, it's very easy for me.

7
00:00:11,800 --> 00:00:13,600
Who provides value and who exchanges resources

8
00:00:13,600 --> 00:00:16,400
Who will levy and move the camp again? Don't come again.

9
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:18,400
What if two people do the same thing?

10
00:00:18,400 --> 00:00:21,600
According to the results, whoever does it faster and does better will get more.

11
00:00:21,600 --> 00:00:24,200
Who just stands and talks about his hard work without even saying a word?

12
00:00:24,200 --> 00:00:27,400
Did you hear that, whoever comes first will always take advantage?

13
00:00:27,400 --> 00:00:29,800
You first flatten your sheepskin and then educate me

14
00:00:29,800 --> 00:00:34,110
When yin and yang come together again, the two of us will lose a piece of flesh together.

15
00:00:34,110 --> 00:00:37,420
Then I'll work on the ropes too

16
00:00:37,420 --> 00:00:41,720
Don't be complacent. Let's compare later on who is slower in making up the dishes and who washes the dishes.

17
00:00:41,720 --> 00:00:44,120
Why can you even roll up the side rope?
